{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A failed exam, a demon-infested island... and an unhealthy obsession with ice cream.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ann and Onyme just wanted to pass their hero graduation test on a chill island famous for its frozen treats.<br>The mission looked easy: defeat a few demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then they accidentally triggered the apocalypse. Oops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the island of Edisap, battle demonic hordes, gather resources, craft gear and potions, and upgrade your equipment to survive the mess you unleashed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with a friend (local or online) in this retro-inspired action-adventure, paying tribute to the classics of the 80s with modern twists and co-op gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you rise as true heroes?<br>Or be lost forever in <strong>The Ann-Onymity</strong> \u2014<br><i>a place where failed heroes fade into oblivion... cone in hand.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3820470?t=1754919125","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3820470?t=1754919125","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820470/1b902d84a539c8c8169d7057e6d5b08df80c2cb8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754919125","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820470/1b902d84a539c8c8169d7057e6d5b08df80c2cb8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754919125","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A failed exam, a demon-infested island... and an unhealthy obsession with ice cream.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ann and Onyme just wanted to pass their hero graduation test on a chill island famous for its frozen treats.<br>The mission looked easy: defeat a few demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then they accidentally triggered the apocalypse. Oops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the island of Edisap, battle demonic hordes, gather resources, craft gear and potions, and upgrade your equipment to survive the mess you unleashed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with a friend (local or online) in this retro-inspired action-adventure, paying tribute to the classics of the 80s with modern twists and co-op gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you rise as true heroes?<br>Or be lost forever in <strong>The Ann-Onymity</strong> \u2014<br><i>a place where failed heroes fade into oblivion... cone in hand.</i></p>","developers":["bouletjv"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820470/28eaf85a1cf6d0765f1f69c78597737f4754caca/header.jpg?t=1754919125","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257175767,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175767/movie480.mp4?t=1754919121","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175767/movie_max.mp4?t=1754919121"},"name":"trailer_eng","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257175767/7ee8b31d71dda20477ec16e285bcb8e126ebd2f6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754919121","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/25717